      "value": "I may have just lost several hours of work from this, since the GUID for `VRCDefaultWorldScene.unity` is different for every project, am I safe just replacing the file from my backup and then renaming it?\n\nEdit: I have definitely lost several days of work because of this (Don't be me, use version control). But just renaming the file after copying in an older version worked for me and for someone else.",
