      "mergeID": "66292157de5e81e5083f1a27",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently VRCDefaultWorldScene is included in the world sdk and is wiped by any sdk updates.\n\nThis has led to multiple people losing their entire scene already as they assume its safe to work in the default scene due to unfamiliarity with unity and the sdks update procedure.\n\nThe SDK includes a scene template for this default scene too, which is opened by default on a new project.\n\nThis should instead be initialized from the included scenetemplate to a file not touched by the sdk at all via use of https://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/SceneTemplate.SceneTemplateService.Instantiate.html\n\nRef: https://docs.unity3d.com/Manual/scenes-working-with.html#creating-a-new-scene-from-a-csharp-script",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Data loss due to VRCDefaultWorldScene being overwritten by SDK updates",
      "parentID": null,
